grund.toml is read as version 2.

unreadable-front-matter
The front matter of a declaration whose kind declares a front-matter field cannot be read as YAML or TOML keys.

Severity: error, fixed.
On: when [schema.kinds.<kind>.fields.front-matter] is set (a setting)
Fix, yaml: fix the YAML
Fix, toml: fix the TOML
Note: The field is present, so no missing-field is reported beside it, and none of its keys is judged.

Next: grund config explain '[schema.kinds.<kind>.fields.front-matter]'
